You have a general-purpose v2 storage account named contosometrics that keeps analytics data in a single container named analytics. Blob versioning is not enabled on the account and soft delete for blobs is turned off. The account's lifecycle policy is maintained in Code View and currently reads:

```json
{
  "rules": [
    {
      "name": "CoolMetrics",
      "enabled": true,
      "type": "Lifecycle",
      "definition": {
        "filters": {
          "blobTypes": ["BlockBlob"],
          "prefixes": ["metrics/"]
        },
        "actions": {
          "baseBlob": {
            "tierToCool": { "daysAfterModificationGreaterThan": 30 }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "ArchiveReports",
      "enabled": true,
      "type": "Lifecycle",
      "definition": {
        "filters": {
          "blobTypes": ["BlockBlob"],
          "prefixes": ["reports/"]
        },
        "actions": {
          "baseBlob": {
            "tierToArchive": { "daysAfterModificationGreaterThan": 120 }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "ExpireReports",
      "enabled": true,
      "type": "Lifecycle",
      "definition": {
        "filters": {
          "blobTypes": ["BlockBlob"],
          "prefixes": ["reports/"]
        },
        "actions": {
          "baseBlob": {
            "delete": { "daysAfterModificationGreaterThan": 365 }
          }
        }
      }
    }
  ]
}
```

The portal lists the blobs that currently exist in the container:

| Blob name in container analytics | Blob type | Encryption scope | Last modified |
| metrics/annual-2024.bin | Block blob | None | 150 days ago |
| metrics/ingest-events.log | Append blob | None | 90 days ago |
| reports/q1-2024.pdf | Block blob | Customer-managed key scope | 200 days ago |
| reports/q2-2025.pdf | Block blob | Customer-managed key scope | 400 days ago |

The team wants to know what the saved policy does to each of these blobs once it has run against them, so that they can judge whether the policy still needs adjusting. Drag each outcome to the blob it applies to.
